Thu Oct  8 14:53:15 UTC 2026 - Dominique Leuenberger <dimstar@opensuse.org>

- Update to version 0.5.alpha2:
  * News in 0.5.alpha2, 2026-10-07:
    + New class: GflsEncodingConverter.
    + New class: GflsUtf8AutoConverter (work-in-progress).
    + GflsValidatedString: make it a GObject class.
    + Change gfls_encoding_convert() API.
    + Remove GflsBytesRegion (no longer used).
    + Reference manual:
    + Write an introduction and a file loading overview.
    + Regroup related classes together in chapters.
  * News in 0.5.alpha, 2026-08-12:
    + New features: GflsByteArray, GflsValidatedString,
      GflsValidatedStringBuilder, GflsValidatedStringChunk, UTF-8 validation,
      and some utils functions.
    + Encoding conversion: more docs and more tests.
    + GflsEncoding: class copied and adapted from libgedit-gtksourceview.
    + Don't annotate get_type() functions with G_GNUC_CONST.
  * Updated translations.

